Subject: sensors: serialize SLPI firmware ownership and drain removal

Keep one firmware reference, cancel queued loads on stop, and finish queued
work before driver state is released. Publish an initialized work item and
remove the sysfs endpoint when the remaining probe steps fail.

---
--- a/drivers/sensors/sensors_ssc.c
+++ b/drivers/sensors/sensors_ssc.c
@@ -20,6 +20,7 @@
 #include <linux/delay.h>
 #include <linux/sysfs.h>
 #include <linux/workqueue.h>
+#include <linux/mutex.h>
 
 #include <soc/qcom/subsystem_restart.h>
 
